tages":[]},{"type":"Upgrade","name":"PRO-Y: Father's Robe","mission":{"requirement1":"During battle, have Matterhorn use Cold Resistance a total of 8 times (excluding Support Units)","requirement2":"Clear Main Theme 3-6 with a 3-star rating; The only Defender Operator that can be deployed is your own Matterhorn"},"stages":[{"stage":"Stage 1","attributesIncreased":"HP +200 , DEF +30 , Block +1","effectLabel":"Trait improved","effectText":"Blocks 4 enemies","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":1},{"name":"Incandescent Alloy","quantity":4},{"name":"LMD","quantity":20000}]},{"stage":"Stage 2","attributesIncreased":"HP +300 , DEF +40 , Block +1","effectLabel":"Snowfield Guard improved","effectText":"RES +18","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":1},{"name":"Data Supplement Stick","quantity":15},{"name":"Polyester Pack","quantity":5},{"name":"LMD","quantity":25000}]},{"stage":"Stage 3","attributesIncreased":"HP +380 , DEF +50 , Block +1","effectLabel":"Snowfield Guard improved","effectText":"RES +20","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":1},{"name":"Data Supplement Instrument","quantity":5},{"name":"Coagulating Gel","quantity":6},{"name":"LMD","quantity":30000}]}]}],"review":{"official":"A member of the\nKarlan Trade Co. LTD\nborn in\nKjerag\n. Matterhorn is part of the cooperation agreement between the Karlan Trade Co. and\nRhodes Island\n, but he also helps carry out missions for the latter as well.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":45,"base":{"hp":1273,"atk":198,"def":241,"res":5,"redeploy":70,"dp":17,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"max":{"hp":1698,"atk":254,"def":361,"res":5,"redeploy":70,"dp":17,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"rangeId":"0-1"},{"elite":1,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":60,"base":{"hp":1698,"atk":254,"def":361,"res":5,"redeploy":70,"dp":19,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"max":{"hp":2264,"atk":318,"def":489,"res":5,"redeploy":70,"dp":19,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"rangeId":"0-1"},{"elite":2,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":70,"base":{"hp":2264,"atk":318,"def":489,"res":5,"redeploy":70,"dp":21,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"max":{"hp":3235,"atk":375,"def":670,"res":5,"redeploy":70,"dp":21,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"rangeId":"0-1"}],"trust":{"hp":385,"atk":0,"def":0}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked at 25 trust","description":"Imaging tests reveal clear, normal outlines of internal organs, and no abnormal shadows have been detected. Originium granules have not been detected in the circulatory system and there is no sign of infection. At this time, this Operator is believed to be non-infected.\n\n[Cell-Originium Fusion Rate] 0% \nOperator shows no signs of infection at this time.\n\n[Blood Crystal Density] 0.12u/L \nThis Operator has rarely come into contact with Originium."},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 50 trust","description":"Since he was young, Matterhorn was trained to be SilverAsh's bodyguard. His father and grandfather were honorable guards for SilverAsh's family. Naturally, this became his goal, as well. However, unlike military training during his father's time, he still had the opportunity to study other subjects. Almost subconsciously, he chose cooking."},{"section":"Archive File 2","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"Compared to foreign nations that are rich in resources, Kjerag has very few edible varieties of plants and animals. Even a wealthy family like SilverAsh's usually only eats plain meals. However, once Matterhorn became a cook, everything changed. His mastery of the art of cooking is awe-inspiring. With just a handful of Kjerag ingredients, he can craft culinary delicacies untasted by native Kjerags. It's no wonder that the politicians of Kjerag used to hold meetings at the government's reception hall, but now they only want to meet at SilverAsh's home. The power of food is truly something to behold."},{"section":"Archive File 3","unlock":"Unlocked at 150 trust","description":"After coming to Rhodes Island, Matterhorn's combat frequency and intensity have increased substantially. His equipment, especially his shield, are in constant need of repair. Matterhorn knows some ways to perform simple repairs in the heat of battle, but thorough maintenance requires the skills of an artisan. Upon being given a recommendation, Matterhorn met Vulcan. Surprised by each other's abilities, they quickly established a long-term relationship: Vulcan maintains Matterhorn's equipment while Matterhorn provides renumeration. When they have free time, they exchange culinary recipes and occasionally share meals together. They are a good example of what close friends should be."},{"section":"Archive File 4","unlock":"Unlocked at 200 trust","description":"Matterhorn's ancestors were born in the norther region of Kjerag where the environment is harsh and people fight against nature day after day. To ensure the survival of the others, when northern Kjerags go out to fight, they are considered dead. This conviction has resulted in future generations of brave warriors like Matterhorn."}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Matterhorn%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Matterhorn%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"Elite 2","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Matterhorn%20-%20Elite%202.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Matterhorn%20-%20Elite%202.webp"},{"label":"Beach Guard GT.001","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Matterhorn%20-%20Beach%20Guard%20GT.001.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Matterhorn%20-%20Beach%20Guard%20GT.001.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Kjerag","type":"faction","entries":[{"operatorName":"Gnosis","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Gnosis%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"Grants Resist to all [ Kjerag ] Operators